.nh
.TH "ORBIT" "1" "Aug 2026" "Orbit Developer Platform" "Orbit Platform Manual"

.SH NAME
orbit-audit-usage - Verify kit imports against the installed package exports


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBorbit audit usage [symbol] [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
Verify kit imports against the installed package exports


.SH OPTIONS
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for usage

.PP
\fB--unused\fP[=false]
	List kit exports nothing imports


.SH OPTIONS INHERITED FROM PARENT COMMANDS
\fB--config\fP=""
	Custom path to Orbit CLI configuration file

.PP
\fB--json\fP[=false]
	Print the report as a JSON envelope


.SH SEE ALSO
\fBorbit-audit(1)\fP
